    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d790">

                <pb facs="0887" n="767" xml:id="pg767"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic">May 5,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 24.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg leave to report that the ukase issued
                    by the Tsar on the Russian Easter Sunday (April 30) makes religious freedom to
                    all Russian sects, except the Jews, an accomplished fact. * * *</p>
                <p>If the ukase is carried out in all its completeness, it will be the greatest
                    concession of individual liberty since the liberation of the serfs, and may be
                    the first step toward a separation of church and state.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. v. L. Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d790-a1.xml" xpointer="d790-a1"/>
